      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p01325",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“我哭了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I cried.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p01325",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "回家以后还哭了一场。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "After I went home, I cried again for a while.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p01325",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "就害怕离开你。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I am just afraid of leaving you.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p01325",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "不过，你还是早点走吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Still, you had better leave soon.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p01325",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "你把我说哭了，我是不会忘记这件事的。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I will never forget that your words made me cry.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
